# A [[respect]]ful [[ritual]] in which normal [[activity]] [[cease]]s and people [[stand]] in [[silent]] [[meditation]] for two minutes; held regularly on [[Armistice Day]], [[Remembrance Day]], and on other [[occasion]]s, to [[remember]] the [[dead]].

